  "name": "WF-00 Dispatcher & Scheduler",
  "description": "WF-00: durable timers + transactional outbox engine. Every minute (or when kicked) claims due ops.scheduled_actions with SKIP LOCKED, routes each to its owning workflow and records DONE/SKIPPED/FAILED (FAILED retries with exponential backoff).",
  "active": true,
  "isArchived": false,
  "nodes": [
